[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:11.68] A wid yettrebbin lexwan
[00:14.41] Yettḥibbin leqran
[00:16.80] Rret-d itij s amkan-is
[00:19.62] Mačči akka i llan yigenwan
[00:22.19] Di leqdim n zzman
[00:24.57] Ass mi akken iseggem ccerq-is
[00:27.07] Ma d Rrus d Marikan
[00:30.05] Ay agad yesman
[00:32.07] Cetkit i ṛebbi ṭṭer-is
[00:35.64] Rret tili, rret tili
[00:39.42] Ad iqeggel Uǧazayri
