[00:52.53]
[01:06.29] Init-as a sidi ṛebbi
[01:08.93] Acuɣer d nekkni
[01:11.26] I terriḍ d ineggura
[01:13.89] Xuḍi d iḥbiben n nnbi
[01:16.28] Nettamen irkelli
[01:18.53] D leqrun ma drus aya
[01:21.04] Terriḍ-aɣ s iri n yifri
[01:24.09] Qrib ad neɣli
[01:25.90] Ur neẓṛi acu ay d ssebba
[01:29.40] Rret tili, rret tili
