[01:59.56] Ma nerra lewhi i lkeffar
[02:02.31] Ǧuǧǧgen am lefnar
[02:04.59] Ugur ur t-ssinen ara
[02:06.95] Limer d i ttammnen meqqar
[02:09.90] Llan deg umecwar
[02:12.03] Ṭfen di nnbi d lawliya
[02:14.37] Xas yuwi-aɣ uxessar
[02:17.31] I ṛebbi ur neqqar
[02:19.37] Acimi i iteg lemxalfa
[02:22.71] Rret tili, rret tili
[02:26.68] Ad iqeggel Uǧazayri
[02:30.96] Rret tili, rret tili
