[02:52.50] Nutni imi ur ttamnen rebḥen
[02:55.18] Nekkni i ittamnen
[02:57.25] Yeṭṭef-aɣ zzman di ṣṣrima-s
[02:59.93] Ayen akk i d aɣ-yuɣen
[03:02.53] D wayen ara aɣ-yayen
[03:04.84] Seg-neɣ i d-yekka nɛemmed-as
[03:07.34] Inselmen irkel tteklen
[03:10.11] Belli ass mi ara mmten
[03:11.90] Ad ṛuḥen ɣer lǧennet mm-leqwas
